			<h2 id="lao-title">Locate An Office</h2>

			<p id="lao-intro">We connect with people in all stages of life, from young children to older adults.  We work with families and children, farmers and businessowners, community leaders and elected officials to build better lives, better businesses and better communities to make Ohio great.</p>

